        {
          "text": " Kopaari Aburaam aibirokin ebuburia, kokieni, kinera kotauke ebe, “Euruuni nopenol ikoku loadau ikar akwatat? Ido ka Sara da naadau ikar akaisakanykaoŋon, eurie?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
