        },
        {
          "text": " Koya Aburaam ikekoku Isimael, ka ŋul kere luaurikinio okaleke, ka ŋul kere luagwelio kikeboro, nolikiliokit kotoma otuŋa lukokal loka Aburaam, kokep kes kapaaran kaŋin amuny naka ekiliokanekec, kwape ketemaria ŋes Edeke. ",
